# Modeling Church Louisiana Post 2026-04-28

A small wooden church, modeled in Houdini. Style from Red Dead Redemption II.

Built around the idea of Components that holds logic.

Six components: Armature, WoodFacade, Roof, Window_A, Window_B, Pillars.

Each one has its own exposed parameters: arch angle, plank count, tile size,

shutter angle, pane count, pillar spacing. The whole thing is reusable on

the next building. The Roof will have a special breakdown later.

Full breakdown on the site: https://zenray.vercel.app/reels/louisiana-bayou-church

Available for UE5 environment and technical art work.

